      i build interactive things end to end — scrapers to shaders to shipped games —
      <span class="dim">after a decade in product design, game design, and creative consulting, and a physics degree from iit kharagpur.</span>
    </p>
    <p class="quote">"i've never learned to keep the physicist and the artist in separate rooms."</p>
  </header>

